{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は午前中雨で\n久しぶりに寒く感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅雨入りしたのかな？\nどうなんだろう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨降ってもお散歩にいけるように\nチップのレインコート新しいの\n買わなきゃ٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのはオレンジ系の虹色に\n茶色で着るとミノムシさんみたいで\n可愛かったの٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂いたものだったから\n次のは私が買ってプレゼントするの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップは、暖色系が似合うんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いの探さなきゃ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\n私、今年は青色と縁がある気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、いろんな色があると\n最近は青色を選んじゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの縁があるな！と思う色は\n何色ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のデートまで\nおあずけです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばみんなが気付かないくらいに\n髪の毛をちょこーっと切ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、写真載せるね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてくれるかな？\n前髪も形変えたんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈さんがその前髪すき！って\n言ってくれて嬉しかった٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスが美味しい季節に近づいてきましたね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１年中アイス食べてるけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわのかき氷食べに行きたい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、伊織を連行して行かなきゃな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、食生活の乱れがすごい！\n1日の中で30分くらい\n一気にドカ食いしちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰か食欲止めて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ブログかきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/05/3811782/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、夕方、お父さんとお母さんとチップと\nお散歩に行った時に見つけた\nイチョウの木！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この緑の葉っぱが秋にはあんなに黄色くなるなんてすごい！"}],"source":"archive"}